Docker:
Create Docker file command: New-Item -Path . -Name "Dockerfile" -ItemType "file"
-----------------------
Docker file code:
# Use lightweight Nginx image to serve HTML
FROM nginx:alpine

# Remove default nginx website
RUN rm -rf /usr/share/nginx/html/*

# Copy your project files to Nginx folder
COPY index.html destinations.html style.css /usr/share/nginx/html/

# Expose port 80
EXPOSE 80

# Start Nginx server
CMD ["nginx", "-g", "daemon off;"]
-----------------------------------------------
 Run this command on terminal: docker build -t devops-mini-project:1.0 .
 Build command: docker run -d -p 8085:80 --name practical-2-container lab-2:1.0
